{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quartermaster is an online co-op FPS with a strong emphasis on inventory management, where you must use a multitude of different weapons and traps to fight tons of dangerous robots.<br><br>Explore Neuraxis, a massive cyberpunk city, and complete objectives with up to 3 friends. <br><br>Strategize and keep only the most important items in your inventory. Don\u2019t get backed into a corner with only a Medkit in hand! <br><br>Communicate with your teammates to get through objectives. To get through this city alive, you\u2019ll need to have good teamwork. Leave no robot behind! <br><br>Watch out for the hordes of enemies chasing you. You never know what could be right around the corner\u2026</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673980?t=1752109363","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673980?t=1752109363","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673980/abd7051870d286f5b4a4dbd4299e7a1b5cc62d82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752109363","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673980/abd7051870d286f5b4a4dbd4299e7a1b5cc62d82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752109363","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quartermaster is an online co-op FPS with a strong emphasis on inventory management, where you must use a multitude of different weapons and traps to fight tons of dangerous robots.<br><br>Explore Neuraxis, a massive cyberpunk city, and complete objectives with up to 3 friends. <br><br>Strategize and keep only the most important items in your inventory. Don\u2019t get backed into a corner with 